WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,620
So cool

2
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:14,650
The bathroom in this room is bigger than the entire house I rented

3
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:17,940
Just live comfortably

4
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:20,850
More than comfortable

5
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:25,730
When I took a bath just now, I almost thought I was home.

6
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:28,440
