Lock the bathroom door before going to bed

9
00:00:34,430 --> 00:00:38,700
It must not be opened at night. Why Rule 2?

10
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,500
The night in the hotel is very scary

11
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,900
after dark

12
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,700
Players, please don’t move around randomly

13
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,700
Corridor Stairs Bathroom

14
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,100
Not safe

15
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:50,220
Forget about corridors and stairs.

16
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:53,220
It's obviously indoors

17
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:55,420
